    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you use <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Transfer\" title=\"Dark Transfer\">Dark Transfer</a></i>, you may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Revivify\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Revivify\">Revivify</a> a creature that died since the end of your last turn. You must succeed on a DC 25 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check. If the check succeeds, the target is unconscious instead of dead but does not heal any Hit Points from the use of <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Transfer\" title=\"Dark Transfer\">Dark Transfer</a></i>. </p>",
